# Per-machine install manifest — copy to your overlay directory as
# manifest.conf and edit the values for this machine.
#
#   yes          install the tool and link its config
#   no           skip both
#   config-only  link the config; the tool is installed some other way
#
# A tool left out of an existing manifest is treated as 'no' and named
# in the run summary. A machine with no manifest at all installs
# everything, exactly as before manifests existed.
#
# The trailing comment on each line lists the platforms that supply the
# tool; a platform absent there needs no 'no' line on that machine.
#
# GENERATED from scripts/tools.tsv by scripts/gen-manifest-example.sh.
# Do not hand-edit: add a row to the table instead.

